# An Empirical Survey of Frontier Efficiency Measurement Techniques in Education.

**Authors:** Worthington, Andrew C.

## Abstract
Discusses the theory of microeconomic efficiency measurement, including frontier efficiency-measurement techniques; reviews the research measuring inefficiency in education; discusses the determinants of educational efficiency; includes table listing author, methodology, inputs and output, analytical techniques, and main findings for 28 studies of frontier efficiency-measurement applications in education. (Contains 44 references.) (PKP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ639061

